  message: "[OWNER RULING 2026-11-15] Every fix that moves an existing stable id shares ONE scheme bump, v14 to v15 (ADR-0035 section 6; no scheme after v9 has been released). This item's const-kind change therefore rides in that bump with the others and does not get a bump of its own, which the title still says. Plan: stable_id_items_review_11152026/PLAN.md."  # 3728
